# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A REAL SMART STUDENT ATTENDANCE MANAGEMENT PLATFORM

## ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, Java Spring Boot developer, React developer, database engineer, security engineer, UI/UX designer, QA engineer, and DevOps engineer.

Build a complete, production-minded, functional web platform called:

**Smart Student Attendance Management System**

This platform must be suitable for a college project, a live demonstration, and future expansion for use by an actual educational institution.

I do not want a static website, a frontend-only dashboard, a console application, or a prototype filled with dummy data. I want a working full-stack application with a frontend, Java backend, MySQL database, authentication, attendance workflows, reporting, validation, and setup instructions.

You must create actual project files, implement the features, connect all components, run available tests, fix discovered errors, and provide clear instructions for running the complete platform.

