# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Develop a centralized attendance management platform that allows an educational institution to manage students, teachers, departments, classes, academic sessions, attendance records, and attendance reports.

The platform should reduce manual paperwork, improve the consistency of attendance records, calculate attendance percentages automatically, identify students below attendance requirements, and provide administrators with useful attendance analytics.

The application must distinguish between attendance entered by authorized staff and attendance collected through optional digital check-in methods.

Do not claim that ordinary software attendance entries prove physical presence. Any QR-based or other automated check-in method must have its own documented safeguards and limitations.

## Primary goals

1. Digitize student and staff records.
2. Provide secure, role-based access.
3. Support class-wise and date-wise attendance.
4. Prevent duplicate attendance records.
5. Calculate attendance percentages correctly.
6. Identify students below a configurable attendance threshold.
7. Provide useful reports and export options.
8. Preserve historical attendance records.
9. Provide an intuitive and responsive user interface.
10. Create a maintainable foundation for future enhancements.

